 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "title1",
   "text": "This is TASTE: what Auracle has learned about your ear, from every pick.",
   "beat": "title",
   "t0": 15.486,
   "t1": 19.768,
   "words": [15.526, 15.706, 15.866, 16.806, 16.966, 17.286, 17.566, 17.806, 18.066, 18.246, 18.586, 18.926, 19.286]
  },
  {
   "id": "title2",
   "text": "Nothing here changes the model. It's the model, reporting on itself.",
   "beat": "title",
   "t0": 20.368,
   "t1": 24.721,
   "words": [20.407, 20.768, 21.028, 21.448, 21.668, 22.508, 22.708, 22.848, 23.34, 23.768, 24.068]
  },
  {
   "id": "tabs1",
   "text": "After a few dozen picks, there's more to read, across four tabs.",
   "beat": "tabs",
   "t0": 26.729,
   "t1": 30.601,
   "words": [26.769, 27.009, 27.169, 27.309, 27.609, 28.349, 28.529, 28.669, 28.829, 29.412, 29.689, 29.989]
  },
  {
   "id": "tabs2",
   "text": "The map shows where your sounds sit. Styles are the separate tastes it has found.",
   "beat": "tabs",
   "t0": 30.901,
   "t1": 35.519,
   "words": [30.94, 31.061, 31.261, 31.561, 31.781, 31.921, 32.161, 33.048, 33.481, 33.721, 33.861, 34.181, 34.601, 34.821, 34.961]
  },
  {
   "id": "tabs3",
   "text": "Directions show what pulls you. Trust shows whether to believe any of it.",
   "beat": "tabs",
   "t0": 35.819,
   "t1": 40.116,
   "words": [35.857, 36.459, 36.699, 36.899, 37.139, 37.81, 38.219, 38.639, 38.859, 39.059, 39.379, 39.659, 39.819]
  },
  {
   "id": "map1",
   "text": "The map places every patch you've heard by how it sounds and how it's built.",
   "beat": "map",
   "t0": 41.729,
   "t1": 45.884,
   "words": [41.77, 41.869, 42.109, 42.509, 42.889, 43.169, 43.429, 43.569, 43.809, 44.009, 44.149, 44.852, 45.029, 45.229, 45.469]
  },
  {
   "id": "map2",
   "text": "Nearby dots tend to sound alike. It's a flat picture of many measurements, so treat distance as a hint.",
   "beat": "map",
   "t0": 46.184,
   "t1": 52.824,
   "words": [46.223, 46.704, 47.084, 47.364, 47.604, 47.844, 48.864, 48.964, 49.084, 49.324, 49.644, 49.924, 50.124, 50.964, 51.204, 51.524, 52.132, 52.304, 52.424]
  },
  {
   "id": "map3",
   "text": "Glow is how much it thinks you'll like a sound. The bank beside it is sorted by the same guess.",
   "beat": "map",
   "t0": 53.224,
   "t1": 58.966,
   "words": [53.262, 53.703, 53.864, 54.064, 54.244, 54.424, 54.684, 54.964, 55.104, 55.284, 56.244, 56.324, 56.564, 56.984, 57.244, 57.384, 57.704, 58.004, 58.164, 58.404]
  },
  {
   "id": "map4",
   "text": "Size is how unsure it is. So a small, bright dot is a firm yes.",
   "beat": "map",
   "t0": 59.366,
   "t1": 63.871,
   "words": [59.405, 59.706, 59.926, 60.106, 60.466, 60.626, 61.338, 61.506, 61.646, 62.286, 62.446, 62.786, 63.006, 63.146, 63.326]
  },
  {
   "id": "map5",
   "text": "A big, bright dot is a maybe. It could be great, and it doesn't know yet.",
   "beat": "map",
   "t0": 64.471,
   "t1": 68.959,
   "words": [64.511, 64.711, 65.071, 65.411, 65.711, 65.911, 66.031, 66.951, 67.071, 67.171, 67.311, 67.931, 67.991, 68.091, 68.331, 68.471]
  },
  {
   "id": "hear1",
   "text": "Click a dot, and that sound is under your fingers.",
   "beat": "hear",
   "t0": 70.2,
   "t1": 72.785,
   "words": [70.242, 70.4, 70.56, 71.12, 71.22, 71.42, 71.72, 71.88, 72.04, 72.2]
  },
  {
   "id": "hear2",
   "text": "The maybes are where to explore.",
   "beat": "hear",
   "t0": 77.185,
   "t1": 79.043,
   "words": [77.224, 77.325, 77.805, 78.005, 78.165, 78.325]
  },
  {
   "id": "hear3",
   "text": "And a dim dot is one it thinks you'd skip.",
   "beat": "hear",
   "t0": 83.442,
   "t1": 85.89,
   "words": [83.483, 83.682, 83.802, 84.022, 84.511, 84.662, 84.822, 84.942, 85.142, 85.402]
  },
  {
   "id": "styles1",
   "text": "Your taste doesn't have to be one thing.",
   "beat": "styles",
   "t0": 90.3,
   "t1": 92.432,
   "words": [90.339, 90.48, 90.86, 91.32, 91.5, 91.64, 91.78, 91.96]
  },
  {
   "id": "styles2",
   "text": "You might love dark drones and bright plucks. One direction would average them into neither.",
   "beat": "styles",
   "t0": 92.733,
   "t1": 97.948,
   "words": [92.772, 92.892, 93.052, 93.373, 93.692, 94.32, 94.513, 94.733, 95.608, 95.892, 96.293, 96.573, 96.933, 97.213, 97.472]
  },
  {
   "id": "styles3",
   "text": "So it keeps separate styles, and a sound only has to please one.",
   "beat": "styles",
   "t0": 98.248,
   "t1": 102.08,
   "words": [98.288, 98.448, 98.567, 98.767, 99.127, 100.028, 100.188, 100.308, 100.627, 100.907, 101.188, 101.368, 101.588]
  },
  {
   "id": "styles4",
   "text": "Each chip plays its style's best example.",
   "beat": "styles",
   "t0": 102.48,
   "t1": 104.803,
   "words": [102.519, 102.74, 102.98, 103.24, 103.48, 103.94, 104.08]
  },
  {
   "id": "styles5",
   "text": "Name a style for what you hear. The name sticks, everywhere it appears.",
   "beat": "styles",
   "t0": 110.603,
   "t1": 114.603,
   "words": [110.642, 110.863, 111.023, 111.283, 111.483, 111.623, 111.763, 112.523, 112.623, 112.843, 113.463, 113.743, 114.003]
  },
  {
   "id": "dir1",
   "text": "Directions shows what each style listens for, in words for what you hear.",
   "beat": "directions",
   "t0": 117.443,
   "t1": 121.663,
   "words": [117.481, 118.093, 118.363, 118.663, 118.863, 119.223, 119.523, 120.363, 120.523, 120.723, 120.983, 121.103, 121.243]
  },
  {
   "id": "dir2",
   "text": "A bar to the right pulls you toward more of that. To the left, away.",
   "beat": "directions",
   "t0": 121.963,
   "t1": 125.66,
   "words": [122.004, 122.123, 122.303, 122.463, 122.563, 122.763, 123.023, 123.203, 123.363, 123.623, 123.763, 124.483, 124.583, 124.723, 125.003]
  },
  {
   "id": "dir3",
   "text": "Here, every style pulls away from grit.",
   "beat": "directions",
   "t0": 126.06,
   "t1": 128.513,
   "words": [126.099, 126.68, 126.9, 127.26, 127.52, 127.8, 128.04]
  },
  {
   "id": "dir4",
   "text": "Some rows share names with PERFORM's controls, like body, grit and space. They're the same measurements.",
   "beat": "directions",
   "t0": 129.013,
   "t1": 135.225,
   "words": [129.053, 129.313, 129.593, 129.913, 130.173, 130.453, 130.793, 131.753, 131.933, 132.521, 132.913, 132.933, 134.013, 134.113, 134.233, 134.493]
  },
  {
   "id": "dir5",
   "text": "Read the whisker, not the bar. If a whisker crosses the centre line, it's still a guess.",
   "beat": "directions",
   "t0": 135.725,
   "t1": 141.015,
   "words": [135.764, 136.045, 136.225, 136.885, 136.985, 137.145, 137.985, 138.125, 138.245, 138.605, 139.034, 139.165, 139.51, 140.065, 140.265, 140.405, 140.545]
  },
  {
   "id": "dir6",
   "text": "A short bar with a tight whisker is a small pull it's sure of.",
   "beat": "directions",
   "t0": 141.415,
   "t1": 144.895,
   "words": [141.453, 141.595, 141.795, 142.055, 142.235, 142.355, 142.555, 143.262, 143.435, 143.615, 143.935, 144.155, 144.375, 144.535]
  },
  {
   "id": "trust1",
   "text": "So should you believe it?",
   "beat": "trust",
   "t0": 146.729,
   "t1": 148.081,
   "words": [146.768, 146.949, 147.129, 147.289, 147.589]
  },
  {
   "id": "trust2",
   "text": "Before every duel, it forecasts your answer. Then you pick, and it keeps score.",
   "beat": "trust",
   "t0": 148.381,
   "t1": 153.031,
   "words": [148.42, 148.761, 149.121, 149.321, 149.601, 150.088, 150.241, 151.081, 151.281, 151.441, 151.976, 152.121, 152.241, 152.441]
  },
  {
   "id": "trust3",
   "text": "On the diagonal, its confidence is honest. The whiskers show how little each dot stands on.",
   "beat": "trust",
   "t0": 153.431,
   "t1": 159.291,
   "words": [153.471, 153.591, 153.691, 154.571, 154.671, 155.29, 155.451, 156.551, 156.611, 157.031, 157.311, 157.591, 157.771, 158.111, 158.411, 158.771]
  },
  {
   "id": "trust4",
   "text": "The number to trust is its score on duels dealt at random. Here, twenty percent sharper than chance.",
   "beat": "trust",
   "t0": 159.691,
   "t1": 165.991,
   "words": [159.73, 159.851, 159.991, 160.211, 160.591, 160.891, 161.031, 161.311, 161.551, 161.911, 162.131, 162.351, 163.431, 164.191, 164.351, 164.691, 165.111, 165.371]
  },
  {
   "id": "trust5",
   "text": "Early on, not beating a coin flip is the honest answer. Keep picking.",
   "beat": "trust",
   "t0": 166.391,
   "t1": 170.639,
   "words": [166.431, 166.651, 167.211, 167.331, 167.551, 167.771, 168.011, 168.231, 168.431, 168.591, 168.851, 169.911, 170.031]
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong1",
   "text": "When it's wrong about you, tell it.",
